### Closed: conditional regions

- [x] `tpl-tour` assembled from THREE samples, so **highlights**, **pricing notes** and **cancellation policy** all render

Webflow omits a conditional region **entirely** when its condition is off, so a region absent from the sample item was absent from the frozen template for every page — and no single tour has all three. `.highlights-frame` came from `matakana-wd`, `.pricing-area` from `rotorua-one-day-tour`, `.terms-special-note` from `black-water-rafting-tour-1-day`. Each is bound per tour and removed when that tour does not have it.

The same class of gap on the **area, tag and category templates is also closed** — see [AUDIT.hd](AUDIT.hd).

### Rich text: figures — code done, waiting on the import

- [x] 10 embedded videos and 6 embedded images were dropped by `html-to-portable-text.mjs`; converter, schema and serialiser now carry them
- [x] `npm run sanity:convert` green — 252 images, up from 246
- [ ] **`npm run sanity:import` — yours to run.** It uploads the six new image assets

`npm run sanity:verify` reported these fields "identical character for character" because it compares plain TEXT, and a figure leaves no trace there.

